{"id":"memorial_101704","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101700","label":"Memoirs · Letters from Girlfriend"},"label":"To J,","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101703","next":"memorial_101705","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101704_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"I'm in a temporary shelter."},{"id":"memorial_101704_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"I don't think this letter will make it to you."},{"id":"memorial_101704_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"However, writing to you is the only thing that can calm me down."},{"id":"memorial_101704_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"The radio said that your entire battalion was wiped out."},{"id":"memorial_101704_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"Please, if you are alive, try and contact me."},{"id":"memorial_101704_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"I kept telling you to get your phone fixed."},{"id":"memorial_101704_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"If you had, I'd at least know if you're alive."},{"id":"memorial_101704_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"Did you ever think about me? Did you ever love me?"},{"id":"memorial_101704_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"If I were you, I would have repaired my phone and contacted you much earlier."},{"id":"memorial_101704_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"I'm tired. So tired."},{"id":"memorial_101704_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_04_description","text":"Please, contact me."}]}